        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of January 31, 2026, we are trusted by more than 88,000 organizations, including our end customers and those of our Managed Security Service Providers (“MSSPs”), worldwide.",
        "start_character": 53538,
        "end_character": 53713
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For customers requiring deeper, hands-on expertise, we offer Resident Services with experts embedded directly with customer teams to provide tailored guidance, ongoing optimization, and support for evolving security needs.",
        "start_character": 51317,
        "end_character": 51539
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our Falcon platform and cloud modules, we also offer incident response, forensic investigatory, and breach recovery services;",
        "start_character": 47746,
        "end_character": 47886
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also increasingly work with Managed Service Providers (“MSPs”), and Managed Security Service Providers (“MSSPs”), who operate the Falcon platform on a customer’s behalf, acting as an outsourced security team to manage risk, products, and outcomes for customers.",
        "start_character": 34898,
        "end_character": 35162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer AI red-teaming and other AI security services to help organizations understand where these emerging models introduce cyber risk, where they can be exploited, and where to take corrective security actions.",
        "start_character": 50192,
        "end_character": 50410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide customized surgical recovery services by providing the tools and staffing to eject attackers out of the network, lock down credentials from further use, remediate impacted systems and ensure adversaries stay out.",
        "start_character": 48947,
        "end_character": 49175
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that any product that was originally designed for on-premise deployments and migrated to the cloud cannot by definition be a cloud native solution.",
        "start_character": 13544,
        "end_character": 13702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that competitors will try to develop products that are similar to ours and that may infringe our intellectual property rights.",
        "start_character": 64215,
        "end_character": 64352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe timely development of new, and enhancement of our existing products, services, and features is essential to maintaining our competitive position.",
        "start_character": 58772,
        "end_character": 58928
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We can rapidly and cost effectively develop and deliver additional cloud modules on our Falcon platform without the need for additional sensors, and are expanding options for our new customers to test modules on a trial basis as well as offering in-application trials for existing customers.",
        "start_character": 27056,
        "end_character": 27347
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have designed an innovative architecture from the ground up to overcome the limitations of existing security products and deliver cloud-based solutions.",
        "start_character": 40162,
        "end_character": 40317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001535527-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001535527-26-000010-7f4b1a98f2126465",
        "accession_number": "0001535527-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer training and certification services to customers and partners on CrowdStrike technologies and cybersecurity topics to facilitate the adoption of CrowdStrike and to broaden and deepen their skills.",
        "start_character": 52151,
        "end_character": 52356
      }
